"""선택 예시 종목-주의 캔들+이벤트+레벨을 아티팩트 렌더용 JSON으로 추출."""
import os, sys, json

ROOT = "/home/jeff/bullet281"
sys.path.insert(0, os.path.join(ROOT, "engines", "engine_fable"))
sys.path.insert(0, os.path.join(ROOT, "engines", "engine281"))
import engine_fable
import engine as engine281
from strategy_fable import STRAT_FABLE
STRAT281 = dict(tp_gate=0.08, entries=("trail",), stop_mode="none",
                fee=0.00015, slip=0.0005, tax=0.0015, round_shares=True)
DATA = os.path.join(ROOT, "data", "data_creon_API", "intraday_5m_by_week")
a = json.load(open(os.path.join(ROOT, "back_test", "weekly_records.json")))
A = {(w, s["code"]): s for w in a["weeks"] for s in a["weeks"][w]}

# (week, code, 짧은설명)
PICKS = [
    ("2025-11-24", "058610", "loss"),   # +32.9% → -42.4%
    ("2024-10-14", "087010", "loss"),   # +26.4% → -32.7%
    ("2026-04-20", "027360", "gain"),   # -64.4% → +39.3% (개선 사례)
]

def week_file(week, code):
    d = os.path.join(DATA, week)
    for f in os.listdir(d):
        if f.startswith(code + "_") and f.endswith("_5m.csv"):
            return os.path.join(d, f), f
    return None, None

out = []
for week, code, kind in PICKS:
    path, fname = week_file(week, code)
    name = fname.split("_")[1] if fname else code
    F0 = A[(week, code)]["F0"]
    bars = engine_fable.load_bars(path)
    ev281, c281 = engine281.run(bars, F0, **STRAT281)
    evfab, cfab = engine_fable.run(bars, F0, **STRAT_FABLE)
    base, case, longL, shortL, initial = engine_fable.classify(bars[0], F0)
    def ser_ev(ev):
        return [dict(idx=e.idx, kind=e.kind, dir=e.direction, price=e.price,
                     marker=e.marker, dt=e.dt, reason=e.reason, note=e.note, pnl=e.pnl)
                for e in ev]
    out.append(dict(
        week=week, code=code, name=name, kind=kind, F0=F0,
        longL=longL, shortL=shortL, long_gate=max(longL), short_gate=min(shortL),
        r281=c281["weekly_return"], rfab=cfab["weekly_return"],
        flips=cfab["flips_used"],
        bars=[dict(dt=b.dt, o=b.o, h=b.h, l=b.l, c=b.c) for b in bars],
        ev281=ser_ev(ev281), evfab=ser_ev(evfab),
    ))
    print(f"{week} {code} {name}: 281={c281['weekly_return']*100:+.2f}% "
          f"fable={cfab['weekly_return']*100:+.2f}% bars={len(bars)} "
          f"fabEv={len(evfab)} F0={F0}")

json.dump(out, open("/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jeff-bullet281/214fe36d-405b-475d-b386-7fa939fbe78b/scratchpad/examples.json", "w"), ensure_ascii=False)
print("saved examples.json")
